WEBVTT

00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:27.114
Kanashimi ikuta noseshi fune

00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:39.294
Horobi no uta no koe takaku

00:00:44.104 --> 00:00:48.634
Kuraki soko yori

00:00:50.084 --> 00:00:55.174
Ukabi koshi

00:00:59.154 --> 00:01:10.294
Aa kimi to ima shirogane o nuke

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:22.044
Ozora e futari tobu hi no

00:01:22.044 --> 00:01:36.224
Kuru o yume min, kuru o yume min

00:01:43.664 --> 00:01:45.294
Wow!

00:01:45.434 --> 00:01:47.504
It's so real!

00:01:47.504 --> 00:01:47.774
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
It's so real!

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:50.444
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
All right, everyone. Take your seats.

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:59.604
Well, as you can all see, Miss Kozuki has worked
hard to create a truly wonderful script.

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:04.584
Maiden of Orleans

00:02:04.584 --> 00:02:05.354
Maiden of Orleans
The script is done, but you all still have a lot
of work ahead of you to make this happen.

00:02:05.354 --> 00:02:07.494
The script is done, but you all still have a lot
of work ahead of you to make this happen.

00:02:07.494 --> 00:02:08.954
It's finished!
The script is done, but you all still have a lot of
work ahead of you to make this happen.

00:02:08.954 --> 00:02:10.024
The script is done, but you all still have a lot of
work ahead of you to make this happen.

00:02:10.024 --> 00:02:11.424
You did it, Michi!
The script is done, but you all still have a lot of
work ahead of you to make this happen.

00:02:11.424 --> 00:02:13.524
Especially you, Miss Kozuki!

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:14.734
What?

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:15.694
Right?

00:02:16.194 --> 00:02:17.534
Huh?

00:02:18.764 --> 00:02:20.324
Revenge.

00:02:22.974 --> 00:02:26.334
You mean me, Teacher?

00:02:26.704 --> 00:02:30.834
Yes! Naturally, the author should direct the play!

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:32.444
Direct?

00:02:32.514 --> 00:02:35.154
Assigning roles, giving stage directions...

00:02:35.154 --> 00:02:40.914
Basically, you're in charge of the
performance at the festival!

00:02:41.154 --> 00:02:43.424
But I can't...

00:02:45.564 --> 00:02:49.084
After all, you've written such a wonderful story!

00:02:49.534 --> 00:02:55.194
Don't you want to work with
everyone to make it a reality?

00:02:56.734 --> 00:02:59.334
Work with everyone?

00:03:01.874 --> 00:03:02.214
The Maiden of Orleans
Roles
Young Girl
Jean
Anette
Dorte
Tronne
Matius

00:03:02.214 --> 00:03:03.044
The Maiden of Orleans
Roles
Young Girl
Jean
Anette
Dorte
Tronne
Matius
Who's playing what?

00:03:03.044 --> 00:03:04.144
The Maiden of Orleans
Roles
Young Girl
Jean
Anette
Dorte
Tronne
Matius
Who'll play Jean?

00:03:04.144 --> 00:03:05.184
The Maiden of Orleans
Roles
Young Girl
Jean
Anette
Dorte
Tronne
Matius
I will! I will!

00:03:05.184 --> 00:03:06.684
The Maiden of Orleans
Roles
Young Girl
Jean
Anette
Dorte
Tronne
Matius
Yeah, right!

00:03:07.014 --> 00:03:12.544
I'm sorry! I need a bit longer
to assign the roles...

00:03:12.754 --> 00:03:16.454
For now, let's just start where we can, shall we?

00:03:17.524 --> 00:03:23.324
As you can see, aside from the main roles,
we'll need to make around 20 costumes.

00:03:23.864 --> 00:03:27.574
I propose dividing the work between the dorms.

00:03:27.574 --> 00:03:29.364
Agreed!

00:03:32.604 --> 00:03:33.874
She finished it!

00:03:35.544 --> 00:03:36.674
Oh, good!

00:03:37.284 --> 00:03:42.684
For a Forime, she seemed unusually
hardworking, but when...

00:03:43.524 --> 00:03:45.074
Hey!

00:03:46.624 --> 00:03:48.054
Azanael?

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:14.914
All right! Now I'll go get the material, okay?

00:04:15.014 --> 00:04:20.054
Yes, please do. And Miss Kozuki,
you'll assign those roles soon, right?

00:04:20.054 --> 00:04:21.614
Er, right!

00:04:22.194 --> 00:04:23.754
Well, I'll leave it to you!

00:04:24.464 --> 00:04:24.964
Yes!

00:04:24.964 --> 00:04:26.064
Right!
Yes!

00:04:26.064 --> 00:04:27.324
Excuse us.

00:04:29.594 --> 00:04:31.724
Er, Miss Senkoji?

00:04:33.204 --> 00:04:34.294
Yes?

00:04:35.174 --> 00:04:37.604
Oh... nothing. Take care, now.

00:04:37.874 --> 00:04:39.004
Yes.

00:04:39.274 --> 00:04:41.364
Aren't those heavy?

00:04:41.444 --> 00:04:42.574
No problem!

00:04:42.574 --> 00:04:46.374
The person closest to Mari...

00:04:48.114 --> 00:04:50.054
Hagino Senkoji.

00:04:50.054 --> 00:04:54.714
I see the Cherry Blossoms are finally
getting ready for the school festival?

00:04:55.024 --> 00:04:56.424
Thanks for your support!

00:04:56.424 --> 00:04:58.624
Director, huh?

00:05:00.894 --> 00:05:05.494
Just when I thought my work was done!

00:05:17.214 --> 00:05:19.344
Ooh!

00:05:20.084 --> 00:05:21.584
Anyone can do this.

00:05:21.584 --> 00:05:22.884
That's not true!

00:05:23.084 --> 00:05:24.484
Be still my beating heart!

00:05:24.484 --> 00:05:26.474
You're wonderful, Lady Hagino!

00:05:31.094 --> 00:05:33.494
Hey... how do you make a slip stitch?

00:05:33.494 --> 00:05:35.594
For Pete's sake... give that to me!

00:05:35.594 --> 00:05:37.824
I was asking Hagino!

00:05:38.404 --> 00:05:39.424
Lady Hagino!

00:05:39.634 --> 00:05:41.304
Is there any way...

00:05:41.304 --> 00:05:42.964
...we could help, too?

00:05:43.334 --> 00:05:44.674
Thank you.

00:05:45.304 --> 00:05:47.334
This doesn't concern you!

00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:48.914
Stay out of this!

00:05:48.914 --> 00:05:50.844
Serving Lady Hagino...

00:05:51.084 --> 00:05:52.244
...is our...

00:05:52.384 --> 00:05:54.474
Raison d'être!

00:05:54.884 --> 00:05:57.184
Raisin... what?

00:05:58.524 --> 00:06:01.424
All right, girls! Care for a snack?

00:06:01.654 --> 00:06:03.024
Ta-daa!

00:06:04.094 --> 00:06:05.424
Finally!

00:06:05.424 --> 00:06:06.954
That's too much!

00:06:08.234 --> 00:06:10.634
I'll eat the leftovers for my midnight snack!

00:06:15.034 --> 00:06:20.204
Don't you want to work together
with everyone to make it a reality?

00:06:23.444 --> 00:06:25.844
Together... with everyone?

00:06:40.494 --> 00:06:41.524
What's wrong?

00:06:43.234 --> 00:06:44.494
Nothing.

00:06:46.564 --> 00:06:47.674
Mari?

00:06:47.674 --> 00:06:49.774
Hmmm? What?

00:06:49.774 --> 00:06:54.734
If not for what happened at Kamioka Island...

00:06:55.544 --> 00:07:01.214
Then I wouldn't be here now.
And I wouldn't have met you!

00:07:02.314 --> 00:07:11.694
I don't remember what happened on the island.
But I'm glad I met everyone... and you, Hagino!

00:07:12.394 --> 00:07:16.594
Besides, I wouldn't be here making
stuff for the school festival

00:07:16.594 --> 00:07:23.094
and having fun with everyone
if you hadn't saved me.

00:07:23.744 --> 00:07:26.574
Well, Mari...

00:07:27.774 --> 00:07:30.404
Actually, I...

00:07:31.244 --> 00:07:33.944
The truth is, I...

00:07:34.884 --> 00:07:36.574
The truth is...

00:07:38.754 --> 00:07:40.684
Did you cut yourself? Are you okay?

00:07:42.054 --> 00:07:44.184
Is this your blood?

00:07:44.724 --> 00:07:49.094
Yes. This is Arume blood.

00:07:52.504 --> 00:07:55.304
We'd better get you a Band-Aid!

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:06.074
You're working late!

00:08:06.814 --> 00:08:08.244
Miss Senkoji!

00:08:10.584 --> 00:08:12.124
Assigning roles?

00:08:12.124 --> 00:08:17.114
Yes... With just the girls in our class,
I just can't seem to make it work!

00:08:17.564 --> 00:08:20.054
What if they're not in our class?

00:08:20.364 --> 00:08:21.424
Huh?

00:08:21.994 --> 00:08:26.904
You only get to do this once.
If there's something you want to try, I say do it.

00:08:26.904 --> 00:08:28.434
Miss Senkoji!

00:08:28.434 --> 00:08:30.664
Don't worry. You have my support!

00:08:32.344 --> 00:08:34.744
What happened to your finger?

00:08:36.374 --> 00:08:39.474
Oh, it's nothing.

00:08:52.824 --> 00:08:54.624
A joint project?

00:08:55.094 --> 00:08:56.184
Yes!

00:08:56.394 --> 00:08:58.034
It's never been done before...

00:08:58.034 --> 00:08:59.364
Please, Teacher!

00:09:01.774 --> 00:09:05.604
And so, we're making it a joint project

00:09:05.604 --> 00:09:09.304
shared by the 11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
and the Blue Sea Dorm!

00:09:14.614 --> 00:09:16.604
Come on in, Blue Sea Dorm girls!

00:09:24.824 --> 00:09:26.264
We look forward...

00:09:26.424 --> 00:09:27.914
...to working with you!

00:09:28.664 --> 00:09:31.224
Now, I'll announce the role assignments.

00:09:32.034 --> 00:09:32.864
Young girl - Wakatake Mari
Joan - Hagino Senkoji
Jailor Woman - Hiroko Funatsumaru
Anette - Kazumi Yamada
Dorte - Futaba Suzuki
Tronne - Mie Sato
Matthias - Akane Kawashima

00:09:32.864 --> 00:09:37.304
Young girl - Wakatake Mari
Joan - Hagino Senkoji
Jailor Woman - Hiroko Funatsumaru
Anette - Kazumi Yamada
Dorte - Futaba Suzuki
Tronne - Mie Sato
Matthias - Akane Kawashima
"Who are you? Where am I?"

00:09:37.674 --> 00:09:41.274
Mari, try to put a bit more feeling into it.

00:09:41.274 --> 00:09:42.974
Oh. Uh...

00:09:44.344 --> 00:09:49.254
"Who are you? Where am I?"

00:09:50.114 --> 00:09:51.884
Yes, like that.

00:09:51.884 --> 00:09:53.284
Um, okay.

00:09:53.284 --> 00:09:57.584
Next, Miss Senkoji, please.

00:10:00.994 --> 00:10:02.694
"Who am I?

00:10:03.434 --> 00:10:06.864
Have you not heard of Joan of Arc,

00:10:06.864 --> 00:10:09.074
once hailed as our country's savior,

00:10:09.074 --> 00:10:12.234
now imprisoned on charges of heresy?"

00:10:13.674 --> 00:10:16.114
Yes, now, Mari!

00:10:19.684 --> 00:10:23.314
"Joan of Arc? You mean..."

00:10:23.314 --> 00:10:25.214
Mari...

00:10:25.584 --> 00:10:26.984
Sorry.

00:10:27.224 --> 00:10:30.684
Do not debase yourself so, Joan of Arc.

00:10:31.564 --> 00:10:35.964
Despite the wretched circumstances
that have befallen you,

00:10:36.394 --> 00:10:40.834
you were hailed once as a holy maiden!

00:10:40.904 --> 00:10:43.904
Wow, Miss Funatsumaru's really good!

00:10:43.904 --> 00:10:46.004
She makes a great lady jailer!

00:10:46.004 --> 00:10:47.804
She's perfect for the role!

00:10:48.674 --> 00:10:52.204
Is that supposed to be a compliment?
Thanks a lot!

00:10:52.884 --> 00:10:56.014
I hope I can do okay...

00:10:56.254 --> 00:11:01.954
Don't worry. Kozuki gave you the
role because she believes in you.

00:11:04.394 --> 00:11:11.624
Tell me, Joan. What were we fighting for,
when we battled side by side?

00:11:11.834 --> 00:11:15.494
Akane! You're pretty good!

00:11:17.274 --> 00:11:19.674
Thanks for setting things in motion!

00:11:20.774 --> 00:11:22.244
I didn't do anything.

00:11:22.774 --> 00:11:28.374
I didn't have enough confidence alone.
You gave me the courage to speak up.

00:11:29.884 --> 00:11:32.684
The courage to speak up...

00:11:32.924 --> 00:11:34.894
Oh, Joan of Arc!

00:11:34.894 --> 00:11:37.324
Akane, you're actually pretty cool!

00:11:46.834 --> 00:11:48.594
Aboard your ship?

00:11:49.374 --> 00:11:52.274
Yes. Tomorrow's the weekend...

00:11:53.174 --> 00:11:54.874
I promised, didn't I?

00:11:55.214 --> 00:11:57.044
Yes! I want to go!

00:11:57.614 --> 00:12:00.604
Yippee! Hooray!

00:12:15.264 --> 00:12:16.524
Are you scared?

00:12:18.664 --> 00:12:22.434
No. It's awesome!

00:12:30.614 --> 00:12:34.074
Ship stabilized. Issuing navigation beacon.

00:12:39.854 --> 00:12:40.944
What's happening?

00:12:41.624 --> 00:12:44.184
The commander's bringing that Forime aboard.

00:12:46.164 --> 00:12:47.684
Aboard this ship?!

00:12:51.804 --> 00:12:53.204
That Forime...

00:12:53.604 --> 00:12:57.264
Wish she'd given me some warning!

00:13:04.214 --> 00:13:06.114
This is it.

00:13:06.244 --> 00:13:07.304
Wow!

00:13:08.314 --> 00:13:10.374
It's sure huge!

00:14:03.604 --> 00:14:05.804
Commander entering bridge.

00:14:08.044 --> 00:14:09.604
Wow!

00:14:10.274 --> 00:14:12.274
Awesome!

00:14:12.984 --> 00:14:16.554
So this is your ship!

00:14:16.554 --> 00:14:18.884
Yes. Our dear friend.

00:14:19.884 --> 00:14:22.114
Blue! Say hello!

00:14:23.224 --> 00:14:25.464
Welcome, Mari Wakatake.

00:14:25.464 --> 00:14:27.654
I-It spoke!

00:14:29.464 --> 00:14:31.264
Surprised, barbarian?

00:14:31.434 --> 00:14:33.924
Hey, I know you...

00:14:35.134 --> 00:14:36.104
Tsubame!

00:14:36.274 --> 00:14:37.564
It's Tsubael!

00:14:39.304 --> 00:14:42.764
And that's Azanael, our freeloader.

00:14:47.344 --> 00:14:50.214
Azanael, this is Mari Wakatake.

00:14:50.854 --> 00:14:52.084
Nice to meet you.

00:15:30.824 --> 00:15:32.984
Oh no! We're sinking!

00:15:38.764 --> 00:15:41.634
Oh dear! What should we do?

00:15:41.934 --> 00:15:43.494
What should we do?!

00:15:57.214 --> 00:15:59.124
You scared me!

00:15:59.124 --> 00:16:00.554
I'm sorry.

00:16:12.734 --> 00:16:14.134
How beautiful!

00:16:14.534 --> 00:16:17.174
Now, hold on tight!

00:16:17.174 --> 00:16:19.234
Hold on?! How?

00:16:51.244 --> 00:16:53.104
That was amazing!

00:16:54.844 --> 00:16:58.044
Thanks for bringing me aboard Blue!

00:17:03.614 --> 00:17:04.844
Mari?

00:17:06.554 --> 00:17:08.854
Actually, I...

00:17:09.754 --> 00:17:10.954
The truth is...

00:17:11.524 --> 00:17:12.584
What?

00:17:17.964 --> 00:17:19.124
Well, I...

00:17:23.334 --> 00:17:24.774
We're stopped...

00:17:27.604 --> 00:17:30.334
Commander! Report to the bridge immediately!

00:17:36.584 --> 00:17:38.484
What happened?

00:17:38.984 --> 00:17:42.854
I don't know. All of a sudden,
all of the systems...

00:17:43.354 --> 00:17:46.554
Blue! Report current status!

00:17:49.764 --> 00:17:51.194
Is everything okay?

00:17:51.264 --> 00:17:55.464
I'm sorry, Mari. Could you
give me a few moments?

00:17:56.474 --> 00:17:57.564
Sure...

00:17:58.144 --> 00:18:02.374
Tsubael! Please take Mari to
the residential zone.

00:18:02.944 --> 00:18:03.874
Roger!

00:18:05.784 --> 00:18:06.874
No.

00:18:07.884 --> 00:18:09.574
I'll take her.

00:18:10.684 --> 00:18:12.244
Thank you, Azanael.

00:18:14.654 --> 00:18:16.124
This way.

00:18:31.044 --> 00:18:33.004
Stabilizing system down!

00:18:39.584 --> 00:18:40.944
Is something wrong?

00:18:41.114 --> 00:18:43.654
It's nothing. Just a small malfunction.

00:18:43.654 --> 00:18:45.114
Oh.

00:18:45.484 --> 00:18:47.754
Well, that's good...

00:18:49.924 --> 00:18:51.964
Engine output declining!

00:18:51.964 --> 00:18:53.164
And the subsystem?

00:18:53.164 --> 00:18:54.524
I can't access it!

00:19:04.104 --> 00:19:05.664
Wow, she's lovely!

00:19:05.844 --> 00:19:08.034
The two of you seem close.

00:19:08.644 --> 00:19:15.554
Yes. Onomil was my dearest partner.

00:19:16.214 --> 00:19:18.814
You mean, your lover?

00:19:19.554 --> 00:19:21.684
In Forime terms, yes.

00:19:22.524 --> 00:19:24.454
When she was alive, that is.

00:19:40.244 --> 00:19:41.674
She's dead?

00:19:44.414 --> 00:19:50.814
The commander she trusted allowed
her to be burned to death.

00:19:51.924 --> 00:19:53.114
What?

00:19:53.424 --> 00:19:54.714
But that's...

00:19:55.354 --> 00:19:56.944
...so awful...

00:19:57.154 --> 00:20:01.994
Till the very end, she called
her commander's name as she died.

00:20:05.004 --> 00:20:06.724
And that's not all.

00:20:10.304 --> 00:20:18.174
At the same time, that commander
massacred countless innocent Forime!

00:20:18.544 --> 00:20:21.444
Wait. Do you mean...

00:20:25.484 --> 00:20:27.184
Kamioki Island.

00:20:27.784 --> 00:20:31.524
The island where you lived with your parents.

00:20:32.664 --> 00:20:34.684
Open up, Azanael!

00:20:35.194 --> 00:20:36.684
Open the door!

00:20:36.834 --> 00:20:38.324
Azanael!

00:20:39.534 --> 00:20:42.974
Shall I tell you what happened that day?

00:20:43.974 --> 00:20:50.074
An investigational crew from this ship landed to
study the ecology of Forime... of Earthlings.

00:20:50.674 --> 00:20:53.174
But the ship's engine malfunctioned.

00:20:54.144 --> 00:20:59.084
The Emil Force Drive,
the ship's main engine,

00:20:59.084 --> 00:21:01.194
emitted waves that produced
a psychological reaction,

00:21:01.194 --> 00:21:03.854
wreaking havoc on the
Forime's nervous systems.

00:21:05.694 --> 00:21:12.224
The affected Forime were annihilated,
along with our landing crew.

00:21:13.404 --> 00:21:19.464
Gripped by terrifying hallucinations, they
attacked and killed each other en masse!

00:21:19.744 --> 00:21:22.174
Open up! Azanael!

00:21:22.574 --> 00:21:24.134
Open the door!

00:21:24.784 --> 00:21:25.384
Azanael...

00:21:25.384 --> 00:21:26.314
The sole survivor was...
Azanael...

00:21:26.314 --> 00:21:27.844
The sole survivor was...

00:21:27.844 --> 00:21:28.974
The sole survivor was...
Please!

00:21:29.514 --> 00:21:31.284
Mari Wakatake.

00:21:33.754 --> 00:21:35.054
You!

00:21:46.334 --> 00:21:48.164
You understand, don't you?

00:21:48.374 --> 00:21:51.464
You realized who wiped out Kamioki Island,

00:21:52.144 --> 00:21:55.874
And caused your parents to murder each other?

00:21:57.814 --> 00:22:00.714
Mari! Listen to me! I...

00:22:01.454 --> 00:22:02.884
I...

00:22:09.294 --> 00:22:11.254
Commander Ekaril.

00:22:13.224 --> 00:22:15.324
Hagino Senkoji!

00:22:20.534 --> 00:22:21.794
Mari!

00:22:23.574 --> 00:22:24.974
Mari!

00:22:24.974 --> 00:22:28.804
Go on. Ask her yourself.

00:22:33.544 --> 00:22:35.034
Why, you!

00:22:35.584 --> 00:22:40.024
Ask her how your parents and
the other islanders died!

00:23:29.534 --> 00:23:37.004
Futari narande te o tsunaida sora ni

00:23:37.814 --> 00:23:47.854
Mirai kasane chikau ano chiheisen

00:23:47.854 --> 00:23:55.524
Kaze ga yasashiku fuki nuketeku youni

00:23:56.234 --> 00:24:04.104
Bokura asu e toketetta

00:24:04.704 --> 00:24:08.314
Nagarete ku toki wa tada

00:24:08.314 --> 00:24:13.644
Shizuka ni kimi wo mimamotte

00:24:13.844 --> 00:24:17.584
Kanashimi mo "Sayonara" mo

00:24:17.584 --> 00:24:23.084
Aoi namida mo tsuyosa ni naru

00:24:24.424 --> 00:24:28.734
Bokura yume kakeru tsubomi

00:24:28.734 --> 00:24:33.564
Kotae sagashi ikiteku

00:24:33.564 --> 00:24:37.874
Hokori takaku saku hana ni

00:24:37.874 --> 00:24:43.574
Itsuka wa nareru to shinjiteta

00:24:43.574 --> 00:24:47.534
In the blue dreams!

00:25:01.164 --> 00:25:05.604
Through Azanael's revenge, Hagino has lost
what she cherished more than anything.

00:25:06.104 --> 00:25:08.404
In the midst of her deep despair,

00:25:08.404 --> 00:25:15.864
she encounters the specter of a former
subordinate who sacrificed her life for Hagino.

00:25:16.974 --> 00:25:23.474
Meanwhile, at Kaio, preparations are underway
for the upcoming School Festival.

00:25:24.854 --> 00:25:28.484
Next time on Blue Drop: Thoroughwort.
